<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>脈輪 on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/categories/%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA/</link><description>Recent content in 脈輪 on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-TW</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/categories/%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>12星座對應脈輪指南：找到你最需要平衡的能量中心</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/12%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E5%B0%8D%E6%87%89%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%80%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</link><pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/12%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E5%B0%8D%E6%87%89%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%80%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;占星與脈輪，是兩套不同的系統——但它們&lt;strong&gt;互相對應&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>接地、淨化、冥想怎麼做？三種日常練習</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%B0%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%86%A5%E6%83%B3%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E7%99%82%E7%99%92%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E5%AF%A6%E4%BD%9C%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7/</link><pubDate>Tue, 02 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%B0%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%86%A5%E6%83%B3%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E7%99%82%E7%99%92%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E5%AF%A6%E4%BD%9C%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;最近心很亂，想找個簡單方法讓自己慢下來？「接地、淨化、冥想」常被放在同一套脈輪練習裡，但三者做的事不同：一個幫你留意周圍，一個整理環境或儀式，一個練習把注意力放回當下。你可以選一種，不必照固定流程打卡。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>脈輪失衡怎麼理解？七個自我覺察提問</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%A4%B1%E8%A1%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E8%A6%8B%E5%BE%B5%E5%85%86%E8%BA%AB%E5%BF%83%E8%AD%A6%E8%A8%8A%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%AE%80%E6%87%82%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A8%8A%E6%81%AF/</link><pubDate>Sun, 31 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%A4%B1%E8%A1%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E8%A6%8B%E5%BE%B5%E5%85%86%E8%BA%AB%E5%BF%83%E8%AD%A6%E8%A8%8A%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%AE%80%E6%87%82%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A8%8A%E6%81%AF/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;最近睡不好、容易焦慮，會不會是「某個脈輪失衡」？先別急著替身體找靈性答案。**脈輪是文化與自我反思的框架，不是診斷工具。**頭痛、疼痛、失眠、情緒低落等情況，都不能靠勾選清單判定成哪一輪出了問題。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>臍輪是什麼？從感受與創作談橘色象徵</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%87%8D%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%A9%98%E8%89%B2%E6%83%85%E6%84%9F%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%96%9A%E9%86%92%E5%89%B5%E9%80%A0%E5%8A%9B%E8%88%87%E6%84%9F%E5%AE%98%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E5%8A%9B/</link><pubDate>Fri, 29 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%87%8D%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%A9%98%E8%89%B2%E6%83%85%E6%84%9F%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%96%9A%E9%86%92%E5%89%B5%E9%80%A0%E5%8A%9B%E8%88%87%E6%84%9F%E5%AE%98%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E5%8A%9B/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;想創作，卻總覺得「先把正事做完」才配休息？臍輪的橘色意象可以提醒你留意感受與選擇。它不是衡量生育力、性慾或創造力的儀表。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>太陽神經叢是什麼？用黃色象徵整理界線與行動</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%AA%E9%99%BD%E7%A5%9E%E7%B6%93%E5%8F%A2%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%BB%83%E8%89%B2%E5%8A%9B%E9%87%8F%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E5%83%B9%E5%80%BC%E8%88%87%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95%E5%8A%9B/</link><pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%AA%E9%99%BD%E7%A5%9E%E7%B6%93%E5%8F%A2%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%BB%83%E8%89%B2%E5%8A%9B%E9%87%8F%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E5%83%B9%E5%80%BC%E8%88%87%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95%E5%8A%9B/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;「我其實想拒絕，卻又怕失去機會。」遇到這種拉扯，太陽神經叢的象徵主題可以幫你整理決定。它不能告訴你身體裡有多少「能量」，也不能解釋血糖變化。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>眉心輪是什麼？用「第三眼」整理直覺與資訊</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%9D%9B%E8%89%B2%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%9C%BC%E9%96%8B%E5%95%9F%E7%9B%B4%E8%A6%BA%E6%B4%9E%E5%AF%9F%E8%88%87%E5%85%A7%E5%9C%A8%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7/</link><pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%9D%9B%E8%89%B2%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%9C%BC%E9%96%8B%E5%95%9F%E7%9B%B4%E8%A6%BA%E6%B4%9E%E5%AF%9F%E8%88%87%E5%85%A7%E5%9C%A8%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;「我直覺這個選擇不對」，可能是你察覺了還沒說清楚的線索，也可能只是當下很緊張。眉心輪的「第三眼」意象適合用來練習觀察；它不是預知能力或健康指標。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>七大脈輪配什麼水晶？選石對照與保養提醒</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E9%80%9F%E6%9F%A5%E8%A1%A8%E6%AF%8F%E5%80%8B%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A9%B2%E9%85%8D%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%9F%B3%E9%A0%AD%E6%9C%80%E6%9C%89%E6%84%9F/</link><pubDate>Tue, 19 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E9%80%9F%E6%9F%A5%E8%A1%A8%E6%AF%8F%E5%80%8B%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A9%B2%E9%85%8D%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%9F%B3%E9%A0%AD%E6%9C%80%E6%9C%89%E6%84%9F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;想用顏色記住七輪，手邊剛好有幾顆石頭？可以對照看看；&lt;strong&gt;這份表是當代水晶文化的配色習慣，不是「哪顆石頭對哪種疾病有效」的表單&lt;/strong&gt;。沒有一顆石頭能替你診斷或「打通」脈輪。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>心輪是什麼？從關係與自我慈悲談綠色象徵</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B6%A0%E8%89%B2%E6%84%9B%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E6%89%93%E9%96%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%9A%9B%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E8%88%87%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E6%85%88%E6%82%B2/</link><pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B6%A0%E8%89%B2%E6%84%9B%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E6%89%93%E9%96%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%9A%9B%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E8%88%87%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E6%85%88%E6%82%B2/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在關係裡，你可能很會照顧別人，卻說不清自己需要什麼。心輪的綠色象徵可以當作提問入口：我願意付出什麼？我希望對方怎麼回應？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>頂輪是什麼？從人生意義談千瓣蓮花的象徵</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%AB%E8%89%B2%E5%86%A0%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E6%84%8F%E8%AD%98%E8%88%87%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E5%9C%93%E6%BB%BF/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%AB%E8%89%B2%E5%86%A0%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E6%84%8F%E8%AD%98%E8%88%87%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E5%9C%93%E6%BB%BF/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;有時你不是缺少「更高的能量」，只是想知道現在做的事對自己有什麼意義。頂輪的千瓣蓮花意象，可以拿來問這個問題；它不是判斷一個人是否開悟的標準。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>七大脈輪完整入門：七輪象徵、顏色與日常提問</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E5%BE%9E%E6%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E8%BC%AA%E5%88%B0%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%9C%B0%E5%9C%96%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E7%9C%8B%E6%87%82/</link><pubDate>Tue, 12 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E5%BE%9E%E6%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E8%BC%AA%E5%88%B0%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%9C%B0%E5%9C%96%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E7%9C%8B%E6%87%82/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;想認識脈輪，先記住一件事：**七輪是一張理解自身經驗的象徵地圖，不是身體檢查表。**你可以用它整理安全感、關係或表達上的困惑，卻不能靠「哪一輪不舒服」推斷疾病。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>海底輪是什麼？從安全感談日常安排與接地練習</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%85%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%B9%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%89%93%E9%80%A0%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%84%9F%E8%88%87%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%B0%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F/</link><pubDate>Sun, 10 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%85%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%B9%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%89%93%E9%80%A0%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%84%9F%E8%88%87%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%B0%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;住處、工作或帳單讓你不安時，「海底輪」可以是一個提醒：先處理眼前的生活基礎。它是脈輪文化中的&lt;strong&gt;安定象徵&lt;/strong&gt;，不是焦慮或疲勞的病因。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>喉輪是什麼？表達練習與藍色水晶的象徵</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%96%89%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E8%97%8D%E8%89%B2%E8%A1%A8%E9%81%94%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E8%AA%AA%E5%87%BA%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%A6%E8%88%87%E5%89%B5%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E8%81%B2/</link><pubDate>Sat, 09 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%96%89%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E8%97%8D%E8%89%B2%E8%A1%A8%E9%81%94%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E8%AA%AA%E5%87%BA%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%A6%E8%88%87%E5%89%B5%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E8%81%B2/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;想把一件事說清楚，卻一直在腦中排演？喉輪可以作為「表達」的象徵提醒：先整理你要說的事，再挑合適的時機。它不是喉嚨或甲狀腺健康的測量方式。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶 x 眉心輪 &amp; 頂輪：一顆石頭，同時打開兩個靈性能量中心</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E8%88%87%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E8%88%87%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;大多數水晶只對應一個脈輪。紫水晶不一樣——它同時連結眉心輪和頂輪，也就是七脈輪體系裡最頂端的兩個能量中心。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>